{"id":"e023abac912d7cb6af2b9fb5107ef5dabc667096","axis":"silent","repo":"withastro/astro","sha":"e023abac912d7cb6af2b9fb5107ef5dabc667096","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/tidy-tags-render.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+'astro': patch","+---","+","+Makes rendering of string tag names stricter and consistent across `.astro` dynamic tags, JSX, and MDX. Only the leading part of the string that is a valid element name is rendered, so characters such as `/` or `=` can no longer change the generated markup. A string that does not start with a valid element name (for example `'!--'` or `''`) now throws an error instead of producing invalid HTML."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/astro/src/runtime/server/jsx.ts","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ import {"," \tspreadAttributes,"," \tvoidElementNames,"," } from './index.js';","+import { sanitizeElementName } from './render/util.js';"," import { isAstroComponentFactory } from './render/astro/factory.js';"," import { renderComponentToString } from './render/component.js';"," import type { RenderInstruction } from './render/instruction.js';","@@ -190,9 +191,10 @@ Did you forget to import the component or is it possible there is a typo?`);"," "," async function renderElement("," \tresult: any,","-\ttag: string,","+\ttype: string,"," \t{ children, ...props }: Record<string, any>,"," ) {","+\tconst tag = sanitizeElementName(type);"," \treturn markHTMLString("," \t\t`<${tag}${spreadAttributes(props)}${markHTMLString("," \t\t\t(children == null || children === '') && voidElementNames.test(tag)"],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/astro/src/runtime/server/render/component.ts","lines":["@@ -28,7 +28,13 @@ import { bufferPropagatedHead } from './head-propagation/runtime.js';"," import { containsServerDirective, ServerIslandComponent } from './server-islands.js';"," import { renderChild } from './any.js';"," import { type ComponentSlots, renderSlots, renderSlotToString